Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.45,0:00:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,YAAAAM!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,YAH, MO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAH, MO! YAH, MO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.97,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,YAH, MO, YAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.57,0:00:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! YH, MjisO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.89,0:01:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Too little, too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.49,0:01:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have four\NExodia cards in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.35,0:01:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have a strong hunch that my next card\Nis the final piece of my deadly puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.59,0:01:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia's left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.11,0:01:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I combine all five pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.57,0:01:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I will summon the unbeatable\NExodia and claim an
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.61,0:01:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,automatic victory as well\Nas your dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Our satellite imaging indicates the rare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.43,0:01:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,hunter's cards are coated\Nwith an invisible ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark's cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.21,0:02:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he always knows\Nwhich card he'll draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But Seto, the guy's a menace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,First he hacks into your\Ndatabase, and now this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.67,0:02:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, I'm well aware of that, but\NI'm willing to let him slide this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.55,0:02:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.87,0:02:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You made me Battle City Commissioner\Nso I could enforce the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me one reason why I shouldn't\Nbust that cheat out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This rare hunter may have\Nsomething I want, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see Yugi squirm when he\Nfaces the same Exodia he used to defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and I attack with Chimera,\Nthe flying mythical beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.73,0:02:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Demolish his stone statue!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.13,0:02:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're left with one monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that even you\Ncouldn't beat me in one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.21,0:02:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is draw my next card,\Nand not only will I win this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:03:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll score an even greater prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.21,0:03:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I won Joey's Red-Eyed Black Dragon,\Nand now I'll take your Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My master will be extremely pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.43,0:03:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will draw the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.33,0:03:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Rare Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.23,0:03:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Time seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That stops me from drawing any cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.19,0:03:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means you can't pick\Nthe final Exodia card yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.97,0:03:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is far from over, Rare Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, a desperate move\Nfor my desperate prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew, I thought Yugi was a gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My Time Seal trap will only last one turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so I've got to stop him with my next card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.75,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win this duel so I can start\Nfiguring out the secrets of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the entire\Nworld depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I can't let him draw\Nthe fifth piece of Exodia,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't just keep skipping his turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a card in\Nmy deck that'll stop this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,rare hunter from summoning\Nthe unbeatable Exodia,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.11,0:04:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and I need to draw it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Light Force Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It will randomly attack\None card in your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,preventing you from using\Nit for three full turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.33,0:04:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll aim for a piece of Exodia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.77,0:04:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control which\Ncard my sword will slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.23,0:04:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If it doesn't get an Exodia\Npiece, I'll lose the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, light my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You pierced Exodia's right arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Rare Hunter only has three\NExodia cards in his hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet, Rare Hunter.\NTo wipe out your monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.97,0:04:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start by sacrificing\NChimera for Summon Skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.77,0:05:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Skull Attack with Lightning Strike
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right. Way to put that Kate\NClown on the endangered species list.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, your Exodia may\Nbe unstoppable as a whole,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.71,0:05:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but the five cards that\Nmake it up are easy prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.15,0:05:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare Hunter, you have no\Nmonsters to defend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a whole new game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just as nutty as a fruitcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole new game?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hardly, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think you can\Nstop me with one card? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A professional card hunter like\Nme is prepared for any situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.41,0:06:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Swords of Revealing Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My magical swords prevent\Nyour monsters from attacking,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can't touch my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And once your life force\Nsword wears off, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use Exodia's right\Narm and summon the beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.91,0:06:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means you won't\Ndeplete my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.13,0:06:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get to him before he\Ngets that last piece of Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, why are we letting\Nthat keep beat Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi should have been\Nprepared for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's about time Yugi felt\Nwhat it's like to face Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll draw one card and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.05,0:07:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my Swords of Revealing\NLight, that's all you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.29,0:07:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're reduced to watching your own duel,\Nunable to attack, unable to even move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.85,0:07:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I should just end your misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wait for your magic\Ncard to expire when
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can draw another right arm from my deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia cards are so rare that most\Nduelists don't own a single piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have three copies of each,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,which means there are two more\Nright arms waiting in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Your deck's loaded down with\Nso many Exodia body parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.25,0:07:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The odds of drawing the\Nright arm are slim to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find out, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mistake is that you're\Nrelying on one monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.37,0:07:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but a good dueling deck requires\Nthe right balance of cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're still a prisoner\Nof my life force sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,which means I have three\Nturns to defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.19,0:07:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, wishful thinking, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.85,0:07:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A second Exodia hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't help, but I've\Nstill got the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.09,0:08:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my swords of revealing\Nlight, my life points are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You still got two turns to figure out\Nhow to stop this card swiping freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.11,0:08:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I play one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And I summon Alpha, the Magnet\NWarrior, in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You forget about my\NSwords of Revealing Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't yet. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.73,0:08:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But once I destroy your swords, my\Nmonsters will be let loose. You won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.95,0:08:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, your deck has a tragic flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cluttered with so many\NExodia pieces that you've squeezed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.05,0:08:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,out room for other cards needed\Nto protect your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You need more magic and trap\Ncards to destroy my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But all you have in your\Nhand are Exodia cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And take a look in front\Nof you, rare hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:09:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already destroyed the\Nonly two monsters you summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.09,0:09:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving you without a single monster\Nto guard against a direct attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.57,0:09:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing stopping my\Nmonsters is your swords card,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.69,0:09:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,a weak and temporary shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.73,0:09:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my monsters are free, I'll\Nbegin attacking your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.47,0:09:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never break free\Nfrom my trap before I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,summon Exodia and obliterate\Nyou and your monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've left yourself wide open\Nfor a direct attack, Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.91,0:09:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you'll summon\NExodia in time. You forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monsters are trapped in my Swords\Nof Revealing Light, and it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.23,0:09:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it's a duplicate Exodia card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes no difference to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.19,0:09:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Light Force sword\Nwill soon disappear,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to access all five pieces\Nof Exodia for an automatic win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But not soon enough. Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.91,0:09:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Yugi does discover some trick\Nto destroy my swords of revealing light?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.75,0:10:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,His monsters will devastate my life points\Nunless I block with a monster of my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.93,0:10:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi forgets that each individual\NExodia piece is also a monster card!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.23,0:10:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can defend myself with\Nmy double of Exodia's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.85,0:10:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be protected and still have the\Nnecessary cards in my hand to summon Exodia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Exodia's head in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you can't strike my life points! Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I wanted\Nyou to do, Rare Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.21,0:10:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for me to\Ndestroy Exodia. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You activated my trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A costly mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.17,0:10:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Chain destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.19,0:10:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It struck my deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.93,0:10:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,While it can't destroy your\NExodia head on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It can destroy the ones in\Nyour hand and your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My Exodia heads... ...are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.07,0:11:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All of your Exodia heads have been\Neliminated from your hand and your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.55,0:11:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And with no heads left to play,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you can no longer draw all five pieces\Ninto your hand to summon Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He found a way to stop\Nthe Unstoppable Exoria!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not through, Rare Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I also found a way around your\NSwords of Revealing Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.85,0:11:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Dust Tornado!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.19,0:11:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap destroys one magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.53,0:11:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shattering your Swords of Revealing\NLight, which allows my monsters to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.09,0:11:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll play Monster Reborn. Revive\NChimera, the flying mythical beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.41,0:11:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Chimera, destroy the final Exodia head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your life points are defenseless\Nagainst my attack I play Alpha,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the Magnet Warrior And Summon Skull
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Skull's electricity raises Alpha's\Nmagnetic attack power by 200 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.53,0:12:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my monsters, attack the\Nrare hunter's life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.21,0:12:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you, you won!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.85,0:12:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it, Yu-Gi defeated Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.21,0:12:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He may have beaten Exodia, but there's\None card Yu-Gi will never beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm the one holding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.51,0:12:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading to Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.87,0:12:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Commissioner, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.47,0:13:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta go and make sure\Nno one else is cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,if you detect a duelist using an Egyptian\NGod card, let us know right away Yes, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.47,0:13:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, my man Thanks, Joey
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there it is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking Joey's Red-Eyes\NBlack Dragon and your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Locator card. You won't\Nneed to find the finals now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.31,0:13:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.53,0:13:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's rubbing off on my fingers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.11,0:13:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All these cards are marked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a cheat. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.15,0:13:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried my best. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't be angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.29,0:13:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Master! Don't! Please! Spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That wacko's lost is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.49,0:14:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Millennium Symbol!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We meet again, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.11,0:14:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember me, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, perhaps you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trapped in the puzzle\Nwhen I dueled little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on\Ndefeating my rare hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,though he was the weakest\Nduelist in my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My other minions will\Nprove much more formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.35,0:14:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Noog, what is with this freak show?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Farrah, I've waited for you for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.45,0:14:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, after all this\Ntime, I will destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not allow my other rare\Nhunters to fail me like this one did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.13,0:14:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have little time for\Nhis kind of foolishness,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.97,0:14:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have taken over his body and\Ntrapped his mind in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.11,0:14:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I am in control!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.62,0:15:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's creeping me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.79,0:15:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you control him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.45,0:15:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of the Millennium items\Ncontains its own unique power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So mind control is a simple\Ntask with my Millennium Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.07,0:15:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No good can come from that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.37,0:15:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The events of the past\Nwill occur once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and that same great evil will\Nreturn to threaten the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.47,0:15:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be the great\Nevil Ashisu spoke about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.77,0:15:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.91,0:15:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.55,0:15:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.46,0:15:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it you want from me, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.61,0:15:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I want what belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll take it using the\Nstrength of the Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But millennia ago, a trio of powerful\Nbehemoths rampaged throughout ancient Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:16:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,These Egyptian god monsters spread\Ndestruction throughout the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.47,0:16:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,until the pharaoh sealed\Nthem away for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But when Pegasus created dual monsters, he\Nresurrected these mighty beasts as cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.99,0:16:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,With these Egyptian gods, I can destroy\Nyou and claim the power I deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.57,0:16:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never claim the Millennium Puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more than the power of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I want the pharaoh's power, the boundless\Nenergy of the ancient ruler himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With it, no one will stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.31,0:16:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use the almighty magic I gain\Nto conquer and lead the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is near, pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to understand why Ishizu\Nasked me to participate in Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.45,0:16:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my destiny to stand between\Nyou and the evil powers you seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:17:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then your destiny is easier\Nsaid than done, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.29,0:17:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Merrick win, or who\Nknows what darkness will come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.55,0:17:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He may possess the magic\Nof the Millennium Rod,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.45,0:17:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have the strength of my puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to beat him, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, your days are numbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So enjoy the game while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your reign is coming to an end!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that guy was a big creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But who knew he was just a\Nfront for an even bigger creep?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.23,0:17:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your red eyes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.07,0:17:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You hold on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.45,0:17:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't mine to take, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.93,0:17:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You want it fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, the Rare Hunters have\Ncollected tons of rare cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Their decks are totally souped up, so I\Nknow that they're gonna be tough to beat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:17:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.33,0:18:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying, one day you'll need all\Nthe powerful monsters you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, you can think of me\Nwhenever you play my red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the least I could do to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,See, during the Duelist Kingdom\NTournament, you taught me rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.51,0:18:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,killer strategies,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.59,0:18:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and everything else that I needed to\Nknow to help me get to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have done it without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.73,0:18:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what friends do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my point exactly, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.41,0:18:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You always have my back, so it's\Ntime I helped you for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I want you to keep\Nmy red-eyes black dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's gonna come in\Nhandy for you sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.59,0:18:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, this means that a part\Nof me will be a part of your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of cool knowing that\NI'm helping you save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.13,0:18:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, I'm\Nstill in the contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I still have the rare\Ncard requirement covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.31,0:18:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, I guess technically\Nyou have it covered, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.35,0:18:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,See, Red-Eyes Black Dragon wasn't\Nthe only rare card I had in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.57,0:19:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me another rare card way back\Nwhen I first started playing Duel Monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Time Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.67,0:19:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it bailed me out of\NJames at Duelist Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.09,0:19:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know it's gonna save\Nmy butt in Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.27,0:19:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, when you think about it, Yug,\Nboth of our hearts are in our decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.65,0:19:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.95,0:19:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, we won't let any\Nduelist beat us. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.83,0:19:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll whoop this Maricree\Nand his rare hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.31,0:19:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Goon Squad so hard they\Nwon't know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.03,0:19:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be sorry they ever\Ndecided to mess with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.47,0:19:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.99,0:19:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I'll take good care of\Nyour red-eyes black dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.85,0:19:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it. It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a true friend, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And together we can take on\Nany evil that comes our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.09,0:19:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of you duelists wants a piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just step up so Joey can knock you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.19,0:19:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi and I are going to be\Ntrailing you every step of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.87,0:20:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The rare hunters have\Nbecome the rare hunted.
